From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SableOS <noreply@sableos.invalid>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 14:40:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SableOS: let Android drive the Q25 charging LED

The UPM6922 charger's STAT pin is enabled by default (the board DT sets no
up,upm6922,stat-pin-ctrl), so the chip lights and blinks the status LED on
its own while charging, over whatever Android's battery light chooses.
Turn the pin off; the lights HAL then shows the battery light colours
(charging and full) on the GPIO LEDs.
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/q20_v12_factory.dts | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/q20_v12_factory.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/q20_v12_factory.dts
index a982a5c..e641131 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/q20_v12_factory.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/mediatek/q20_v12_factory.dts
@@ -499,6 +499,10 @@
 		up,upm6922,boostv = <5000>;            /* unit:1mV */
 		up,upm6922,boosti = <1200>;            /* unit:1mA */
 		up,upm6922,vac-ovp = <14000>;          /* unit:1mV */
+		/* SableOS: STAT pin off (REG00[6:5] = 11), so the charger chip no longer
+		 * blinks the status LED itself and Android's battery light shows the
+		 * charging and full colours. */
+		up,upm6922,stat-pin-ctrl = <3>;
 		
 		bc12_sel = <&mtk_ctd>;
 		boot_mode = <&chosen>;
-- 
